#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8549
msgid ""
"This replaces this game's pictures, music, video and media settings. Game "
"files and saves are kept."
msgstr ""
"Isto substitui as imagens, a música, o vídeo e as definições de multimédia "
"deste jogo. Os ficheiros e os dados guardados do jogo são mantidos."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8549
